{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:df45f9ef10c3cd40","name":"Holographic Image Disguiser","source":{"id":"source:reference-df45f9ef10c3cd40","title":"Holographic Image Disguiser","revision":21052,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:04:13Z","sha256":"15912b3fdf2118fdd2665c477d076086a83ae4601e4f3006c97a408897c016f9","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21052","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Holographic%20Image%20Disguiser&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-df45f9ef10c3cd40","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["IMAGE DISGUISER\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["COST\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["WEIGHT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["AVAILABILITY\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Standard\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["20,000 x ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Factor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Factor"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["(20 x ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Factor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Factor"},") Kilograms\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Advanced\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["(20,000 x ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Factor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Factor"},") x 2\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["(20 x ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Factor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Factor"},") Kilograms\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["A Holographic Image Disguiser hides a Droid's true appearance. A central processor installed in the Droid's chassis coordinates several small, full-color, high-resolution holoprojectors installed at various points on the Droid's body. The Disguiser's processor synchronizes the holographic image with the Droid's movements and it's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vocabulator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vocabulator","referenceId":"reference:a28880d579fbd223"},", making the disguise particularly lifelike.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The basic model is essentially a standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Holoshroud"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Holoshroud","referenceId":"reference:43b0258bed8f386b"},", granting the Droid a +10 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," checks using ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deceptive Appearance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deceptive_Appearance"},". An advanced model, for double the price, includes sensor nodes that track a number of other factors, such as ambient temperature and weather conditions, making the image react to those variables. The advanced model allows the Droid to disguise its appearance as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"}," at no penalty.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
